CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[48,55,40,39,20,27],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"97","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东吴武将，官至游击将军。天纪四年，晋将王濬率七万水军沿长江东进伐吴。张象与陶濬率二万水军戍守石头城，行军途中突遇西北风，军旗倒伏，士卒溃散，仅剩数十人。张象于是向王濬投降，并作为前部引导晋军进入石头城。孙皓闻讯，自缚出降。","tc":"東吳武將，官至游擊將軍。天紀四年，晉將王濬率七萬水軍沿長江東進伐吳。張象與陶濬率二萬水軍戍守石頭城，行軍途中突遇西北風，軍旗倒伏，士卒潰散，僅剩數十人。張象于是向王濬投降，并作為前部引導晉軍進入石頭城。孫皓聞訊，自縛出降。","en":"An Eastern Wu Officer who rose to the rank of General of Agile Cavalry. In the 4th year of Tianji, the Jin general Wang Jun led a Navy of 70,000 eastward along the Yangtze River to attack Wu. Zhang Xiang and Tao Jun led a Navy of 20,000 to garrison Stone Citadel. On their march, a sudden northwest wind arose, felling their army banners and scattering their troops until only a few dozen remained. Zhang Xiang then decided to Surrender to Wang Jun and served as the vanguard to guide the Jin forces into Stone Citadel. Upon hearing the news, Sun Hao bound himself and came forth to surrender.","jp":"呉の武将。官位は遊撃将軍に至る。天紀四年、晋将の王濬が七万の水軍を率いて長江沿いに東進して呉を討伐すると、張象は陶濬とともに二万の水軍を率いて石頭城の守備にあたった。しかし行軍途中で突如北西の風に見舞われ、軍旗が倒れて兵卒は四散し、残ったのはわずか数十人となった。張象は王濬に降伏し、前部として晋軍を石頭城へと導いた。孫晧はこれを聞き、自ら身を縛って降伏した。","kr":"동오의 무장으로 관직은 유격장군에 이르렀다. 천기 4년, 진나라 장수 왕준이 7만 수군을 이끌고 장강을 따라 동진하여 오나라를 정벌하려 했다. 장상은 도준과 함께 2만 수군을 이끌고 석두성을 수비하러 가던 중, 행군 길에 갑자기 서북풍이 불어닥쳐 군기가 쓰러지고 사졸들이 흩어지는 바람에 겨우 수십 명만이 남았다. 이에 장상은 왕준에게 항복하고, 선봉이 되어 진군을 석두성으로 인도했다. 손호는 이 소식을 듣고 스스로 몸을 묶어 나와 항복했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1032915","remark":"普武","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"象","nameTc":"象","nameEn":"Xiang","nameJp":"象","nameKr":"